  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Eoraptor lunensis has a light bipedal body, compact low skull, grasping forelimbs and long balancing tail. Skin, colour, posture and dimensions are artistic estimates; historical museum classifications and diet labels are not treated as settled conclusions.",
    "zh": "始盗龙 Eoraptor lunensis 具有轻巧的双足身体、紧凑低矮的头骨、抓握前肢和长平衡尾。皮肤、颜色、姿态及尺寸为艺术估计；不把旧博物馆资料的分类与食性标签视为已定结论。"
  },
